Software
--------
Execution framework uses SQLite and SQLGlot (MIT);
https://github.com/tobymao/sqlglot

Integrity
---------
The agent never reads test references, grading databases or expected-result
fingerprints. All model prompts, generated text and token counts for the final
run are recorded in outputs/llm_trace.jsonl inside the source archive.
External assistance (Trae AI coding assistant) is disclosed in the report.
